sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Outreach Operator
    participant UI as Watermelon UI (SPA)
    participant API as FastAPI Web Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini AI
    participant Gmail as Google Gmail API
    participant Sheets as Google Sheets API

    Note over User, Sheets: Step 1: Contact Ingestion & Pre-Send Verification
    User->>UI: Sync Contacts from Google Sheet
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/contacts/sync-sheets
    API->>Sheets: spreadsheets.values.get (A2:G100)
    Sheets-->>API: Prospect Rows
    API->>API: Run RFC Syntax, DNS MX, & Disposable Checks
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO contacts (status = 'VERIFIED')
    API-->>UI: Return Verified Contact List

    Note over User, Gemini: Step 2: AI Personalization & Human Review
    User->>UI: Select Verified Contacts -> "Generate AI Drafts"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/campaigns/{id}/generate-drafts
    API->>Gemini: Prompt (Resume Profile + Prospect Context)
    Gemini-->>API: Structured JSON {subject, body_markdown}
    API->>API: Scan for unparsed placeholders ({{...}})
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO messages (status = 'DRAFT_PENDING_REVIEW')
    API-->>UI: Display Drafts in Review Queue

    Note over User, DB: Step 3: Human-in-the-Loop Approval & Scheduling
    User->>UI: Inspect & Edit Draft -> Click "Approve"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/messages/{id}/approve
    API->>DB: UPDATE messages SET status = 'SCHEDULED', scheduled_for = T + Jitter
    API-->>UI: Draft Approved & Scheduled

    Note over Worker, Gmail: Step 4: Worker Dispatch & Idempotent Send
    loop Every 5 Seconds (Worker Polling)
        Worker->>DB: SELECT * FROM messages WHERE scheduled_for <= NOW() FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        DB-->>Worker: Acquire Row Lease (status = 'SENDING')
        Worker->>Gmail: users.messages.send (Multipart MIME with tracking header)
        Gmail-->>Worker: HTTP 200 OK (gmail_message_id, thread_id)
        Worker->>DB: UPDATE messages SET status = 'SENT', gmail_message_id = ...
        Worker->>Sheets: spreadsheets.values.batchUpdate (Row Status = "SENT")
    end

    Note over Gmail, DB: Step 5: Telemetry Tracking & Reply Detection
    opt Open Pixel Requested
        Gmail->>API: GET /api/v1/telemetry/pixel/{tracking_id}.png
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO message_events (event_type = 'OPEN')
    end

    loop Every 5 Minutes (Reply Detector)
        Worker->>Gmail: users.threads.get (thread_id)
        Gmail-->>Worker: Thread Message History
        Worker->>DB: If reply from prospect: UPDATE messages SET status = 'REPLIED'
    end
